#: input/pagecontent/transaction-retrieve-MHD-folder-request-trigger-events.md:1
msgid "The retrieve VHL folder docs request transaction is initiated when the host country EMR has extracted a VHL payload from a QR code that was scanned and the decrypted CWT decrypted yielded a HCERT payload that wrapped the VHL payload within it."
msgstr "当东道国 EMR 从扫描的 QR 码中提取出 VHL 载荷，且解密后的 CWT 得到一个内含该 VHL 载荷的 HCERT 载荷时，即发起检索 VHL 文件夹文档请求事务。"
